# The everyday sweep stops here: 71 commands, 14 of 55 rooms
# searched, the whole ground floor toured. Bronze is Inform 7 and
# runs roughly forty times the instructions per turn that an Inform
# 6 game does, so its full 934-command walk takes minutes where
# every other recording in this corpus takes seconds, and a sweep
# that waits for it is a sweep nobody runs.
#
# The winning walk is still here, whole, below this line. Delete
# the fence to replay it: an unclosed fence skips the rest of the
# file, which is what makes "replay only up to here" a one-line
# edit (acceptance.py: the grammar, line by line).

